<title>CHINA: Cho Hung Bank to set US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Cho Hung Bank to set US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cho Hung Bank has mandated Societe Generale Asia to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>The issue has a final maturity of one year and is expected to be completed on a club-deal basis.</p>
<p>The FRN is expected to pay an all-in return &quot;in the mid 50s&quot; basis points, bankers said.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
